// =========================================================================
// DEFERRED FUTURE ROADMAP (Saved from discussion):
// =========================================================================
// 1. Dedicated String Type (fastlang_str):
//    - Separate 'str' from 'fastlang_slice<char>' into its own dedicated struct 'fastlang_str'.
//    - Allow 'impl str' to have string-specific methods (split, trim, to_upper, contains, etc.)
//      without polluting generic array slices.
//
// 2. Micro Architecture Split:
//    - Normal runtime micros: keep as high-performance C++ inline functions.
//    - Compile-time syntactic micros: AST subtree injection for code wrappers (e.g. try_in_me).
//
// 3. Yield inside Functions (fn):
//    - Normal 'fn' returns normally.
//    - Future support for 'yield' inside 'fn' when an explicit 'yield' handle is provided.
//
// 4. Lambda First-Class Parser & Representation:
//    - Explicit syntax and parsing for 'lambda<Ret(Args...)>'.
// =========================================================================

